 "notes": "Eight frames slower with a second pile-driver in the chain and ultra-tier hitstop: the hardest single hit any non-ultra weapon has.\n\nLineage: maul — A quarry maul swung round rather than dropped: it arrives from the side and it takes the wielder with it.\nMandatory slots present: 25/25. Total slots: 29.\nart.1/art.2 trigger: the schema's trigger block cannot express a chord, so the declared button is 'two_hand' with modifier hold/double_tap. The runtime conjunction is 'heavy pressed while two_hand is HELD' (art.1) and 'heavy HELD while two_hand is HELD' (art.2) — game/data/weapons/input-map.json is authoritative and machine-readable."
